{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10111040","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10111040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011101001:":{"text":"콜린, 우린 이제 어쩌면 좋겠나?","source_cn":"科林，我们怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDA577A62ECB688","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011101002:":{"text":"와일더스 사람들은 대체 왜 저희를 내쫓는 거죠?","source_cn":"绿裔的人为什么要赶我们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BB3AFF9E06469A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011102001:":{"text":"콜린 씨, 배! 배가 왔어요!","source_cn":"科林先生，船！有船来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D510E95154D679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011102002:":{"text":"또 피난민이 온 건가?","source_cn":"又有逃难者来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B729AFC2C0D7BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011103001:":{"text":"돌아가. 여긴 오래 머물 곳이 못 되니.","source_cn":"回去吧，这里无法长待","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410A168A89354123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011104001:0":{"text":"헤엑! 이게 어떻게 된 거죠?!\n땅거미 숲은 분명 <style=\"highlight\">와일더스 연맹</style>의 구역인데, 여긴 온통 레오프론 사람들뿐이에요!","source_cn":"哇哇哇，这是怎么回事？！\\n薄暮丛林明明应该是绿裔联盟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC10D461D076818B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011104002:0":{"text":"게다가 다들 땅바닥에서 구르기라도 한 것처럼 지저분해요... 딱해라.","source_cn":"而且看大家的样子，像是在地上滚过一样，脏兮兮的……好可怜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65AD916E007992D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1011104002":{"text":"게다가 다들 땅바닥에서 구르기라도 한 것처럼 지저분해요... 딱해라.","source_cn":"而且看大家的样子，像是在地上滚过一样，脏兮兮的……好可怜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65AD916E007992D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011104003:0":{"text":"이봐, 배가 있으면 얼른 떠나.","source_cn":"你们几个，既然有船，就快走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADC1F9AFB1400272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1011104004:1":{"text":"그리고 배에 빈자리가 있다면, 내 뒤에 있는 저 불쌍한 피난민들을 태워서 같이 떠나도록 해.","source_cn":"要是还有空舱，就把我身后那些可怜的逃难者也接上船，赶快...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2E919B0267F21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1011104004":{"text":"그리고 배에 빈자리가 있다면, 내 뒤에 있는 저 불쌍한 피난민들을 태워서 같이 떠나도록 해.","source_cn":"要是还有空舱，就把我身后那些可怜的逃难者也接上船，赶快离开这里吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2E919B0267F21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011104005:1":{"text":"저기, 콜린 형님. 당신들이 누구든, 어디에서 왔든 간에 이곳은 아무리 봐도 야영을 하기 적합하지 않은 것 같은데요.","source_cn":"我说科林老兄，先不管你们是谁，从哪儿来，这地方怎么看都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B7BBE97724504FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1011104006:1":{"text":"강가는 습하고 추워서 좋지 않으니 어서 사람들을 데리고 숲으로 들어가세요. 저희 종족 사람들이 그들을 잘 돌보아줄 거예요!","source_cn":"河边潮湿又阴冷，对身体不好，快带大家进丛林吧，我的族人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0808CB7016C30267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011104007:1":{"text":"그... 그 귀... 자네 와일더스 연맹 사람인가?","source_cn":"你……那双耳朵，你是绿裔联盟的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD50EB11DD5ED1C6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011104008:1":{"text":"그렇답니다! 이 두 귀로 조금 전 사람들이 당신의 이름을 부르는 걸 들었죠.","source_cn":"没错，科林老兄！凭借这双耳朵，我听到他们刚才叫你的名字来着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEE00B5D6DB8C740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011104009:1":{"text":"...당신들이 갑자기 <style=\"highlight\">봉쇄령</style>을 내리는 바람에 간신히 물을 건너온 인간 난민들이 강제로 땅거미 숲을 떠날 수밖에 없었어. 이 일에 대해 아직 당신들한테 제대로 따지지도 못했다고!","source_cn":"——就是你们，突然下达<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x983F3F85A4CD6F57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011104010:1":{"text":"주변을 봐. 이게 와일더스 연맹이 손님을 대하는 방식인가?! 평화와 관용을 노래하던 당신들은 다 어딜 간 거지?","source_cn":"看看周围的老弱妇孺，这是绿裔联盟的待客之道吗？！你们往...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AFF72776290B740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1011104011:1":{"text":"자자자, 잠깐만요. 봉쇄령이라뇨?","source_cn":"等等等，等一下，什么封锁令？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E4A68E643D464BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1011104012:1":{"text":"더 말할 것도 없어. 강경책을 써서라도 오늘 당장 저 사람들을 데리고 숲으로 들어가겠어!","source_cn":"多说无益，就算用强硬手段，今天我也要带他们进丛林！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07A71F61A434574E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"피난민...?","source_cn":"逃难者……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A93B2E958AD0C9D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"피난민...?","female":"피난민...?","variant_male_record_inde